  "solution": {
    "text": "Inside planet<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></math><br />Force to keep the wire at rest (F)<br />= weight of wire<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Here, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mo>=</mo></math> density of earth <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Also, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ; putting all values, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
